  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p /><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"c5405c47-a171-4c20-871d-c537cca4d23a\"><ac:rich-text-body><h3>Compatibility across different versions</h3><p>Integration with Odoo version 16 is available from Bahmni Standard 1.0.0 (on docker) and it is the supported version going forward.</p><p>Odoo 10 is also available on bahmni-docker for implementers to help migrate from 0.93 to latest version with a database backup, but will not receive any updates or security patches and it is recommended to migrate to Odoo 16.</p><p>Integration with Odoo version 10 is only available from Bahmni 0.92 version onwards. </p><p>Bahmni 0.91 and earlier works with OpenERP 7.&nbsp;</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p /><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Bahmni integrates OpenMRS with </span><a href=\"https://www.odoo.com/\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Odoo</span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">, an open source ERP product. Through Odoo, you can then manage Customers, Billing, Pharmacy and Stock management etc.&nbsp;</span>Before you start using Odoo, you need to setup Odoo as per your operational needs. This is only meant to be a guide for effectively working with the rest of Bahmni components (mainly EMR).&nbsp; For comprehensive guide on setup and usage of Odoo, please refer to the <a href=\"https://www.odoo.com/documentation/16.0/\">Odoo 16 documentation</a>. Odoo has wonderful webinars, easily available on its Youtube channel.&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">The pages listed below assist you to setup and configure Odoo to work effectively in conjunction with Bahmni Clinical functions.&nbsp;</span></p><p /><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"f2d1a523-5824-4432-8e9f-4d93e78f91a7\" ac:macro-id=\"c95c4252-fb01-4963-bede-3caa88476fc0\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#1FA5A0</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"children\" ac:schema-version=\"2\" data-layout=\"default\" ac:local-id=\"23d27728-377e-4bb4-8d73-170750257a8c\" ac:macro-id=\"01dc3a2d-c881-4e94-8c2b-84e7afd86e90\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"excerptType\">simple</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p /><p />",
      "representation": "storage",
      "embeddedContent": [],
      "_expandable": {
