      }
    },
    "view": {
      "value": "<p /><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"c5405c47-a171-4c20-871d-c537cca4d23a\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><h3 id=\"Odoomodules-Compatibilityacrossdifferentversions\">Compatibility across different versions</h3><p>Integration with Odoo version 16 is available from Bahmni Standard 1.0.0 (on docker) and it is the supported version going forward.</p><p>Odoo 10 is also available on bahmni-docker for implementers to help migrate from 0.93 to latest version with a database backup, but will not receive any updates or security patches and it is recommended to migrate to Odoo 16.</p><p>Integration with Odoo version 10 is only available from Bahmni 0.92 version onwards. </p><p>Bahmni 0.91 and earlier works with OpenERP 7. </p></div></div><p /><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Bahmni integrates OpenMRS with </span><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.odoo.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Odoo</span></a><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">, an open source ERP product. Through Odoo, you can then manage Customers, Billing, Pharmacy and Stock management etc. </span>Before you start using Odoo, you need to setup Odoo as per your operational needs. This is only meant to be a guide for effectively working with the rest of Bahmni components (mainly EMR).  For comprehensive guide on setup and usage of Odoo, please refer to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.odoo.com/documentation/16.0/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Odoo 16 documentation</a>. Odoo has wonderful webinars, easily available on its Youtube channel. </p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">The pages listed below assist you to setup and configure Odoo to work effectively in conjunction with Bahmni Clinical functions. </span></p><p /><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-layout=\"default\" data-local-id=\"f2d1a523-5824-4432-8e9f-4d93e78f91a7\" data-macro-id=\"c95c4252-fb01-4963-bede-3caa88476fc0\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-layout=\"default\" data-local-id=\"23d27728-377e-4bb4-8d73-170750257a8c\" data-macro-id=\"01dc3a2d-c881-4e94-8c2b-84e7afd86e90\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3692167169/Odoo+16+System+Configuration\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3692167169\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Odoo 16 System Configuration</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/900530238/Odoo+10+System+Configuration\" data-linked-resource-id=\"900530238\" data-linked-resource-version=\"14\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Odoo 10 System Configuration</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/900464675/Odoo+Sales+Configuration\" data-linked-resource-id=\"900464675\" data-linked-resource-version=\"18\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Odoo Sales Configuration</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/900497457/Odoo+Purchase+Configuration\" data-linked-resource-id=\"900497457\" data-linked-resource-version=\"8\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Odoo Purchase Configuration</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/900530219/Odoo+Accounting+Configuration\" data-linked-resource-id=\"900530219\" data-linked-resource-version=\"12\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Odoo Accounting Configuration</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/900530225/Odoo+Inventory+Configuration\" data-linked-resource-id=\"900530225\" data-linked-resource-version=\"12\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Odoo Inventory Configuration</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3690168321/Custom+Reports+in+Odoo+16\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3690168321\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Custom Reports in Odoo 16</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3657105447/Odoo+16+Migration+Guide\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3657105447\" data-linked-resource-version=\"7\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Odoo 16 Migration Guide</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3690725380/Optional+Community+Modules+for+Odoo+16\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3690725380\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Optional Community Modules for Odoo 16</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/900530355/ERP+FAQs+Troubleshooting\" data-linked-resource-id=\"900530355\" data-linked-resource-version=\"8\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">ERP FAQs &amp; Troubleshooting</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/2136473610/Viewing+Odoo+Payments+in+Clinical+screens+in+Bahmni\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2136473610\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Viewing Odoo Payments in Clinical screens in Bahmni</a></li></ul>\n</div></div><p /><p />",
